BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Travel and Expense Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Policy code: POL-FIN-007 | Owner: Group Finance | Effective date: 1 April 2025 | Version: 2) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 679 Td (This version supersedes version 1 dated 1 April 2024. Claims for expenses incurred on or after) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 666 Td (1 April 2025 are assessed under this version.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 641 Td (Summary of changes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 619 Td (- Approval thresholds raised: line managers approve claims up to \243750 and budget holders up) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 606 Td (   to \2433,000; claims above \2433,000 go to the CFO, following the removal of the Finance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 593 Td (   Director role.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 580 Td (- Per-diem and hotel caps updated for all cities, and Munich added.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 567 Td (- Claim deadline shortened from 90 days to 60 days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (- Itemised receipts now required for every item over \2435.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 541 Td (- First class rail now permitted only for journeys over 4 hours.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528 Td (- Economy class now applies to flights under 8 hours.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 515 Td (- Client entertainment, team meal and working-late meal limits increased.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 502 Td (- International Travel Pre-Approval \(F-221\) must now be submitted 14 days before travel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 489 Td (- Mileage rates for the Netherlands, United States and Malaysia updated.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 473 Td (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 451 Td (This policy sets out how Meridian Instruments Ltd employees travel on company business and how) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 438 Td (they are reimbursed for reasonable expenses incurred while doing their job. It applies to all) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 425 Td (employees, contractors engaged through Meridian payroll and temporary staff at every Meridian) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 412 Td (site: Leeds, Rotterdam, Austin and Penang.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 390 Td (The principle behind the policy is simple. Spend Meridian's money as carefully as you would) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 377 Td (spend your own. Choose the most economical option that still allows you to do your work safely) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 364 Td (and effectively, and never make or receive a claim that you would not be comfortable explaining) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 351 Td (to a colleague in Finance.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 326 Td (2. Scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 304 Td (This policy covers business travel \(air, rail, road, taxis and hire cars\), hotel accommodation,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 291 Td (meals and daily subsistence, client entertainment, and other out-of-pocket business costs such) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 278 Td (as professional subscriptions and small purchases.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 256 Td (It does not cover the purchase of goods or services from suppliers, which must be raised as a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 243 Td (purchase requisition under the Procurement Manual \(POL-FIN-012\) and approved in line with the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 230 Td (Delegation of Authority and Approval Matrix \(POL-FIN-003\). Use of the Northgate Commercial Card) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 217 Td (is governed by the Corporate Card Policy \(POL-FIN-009\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 192 Td (3. Before you travel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 170 Td (All travel must have a clear business purpose and be agreed in advance with your line manager.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 157 Td (Consider whether a video call on Teams would achieve the same result before booking a trip.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 144 Td (Where several colleagues are attending the same event, coordinate so that the number of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 131 Td (travellers is kept to the minimum needed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 109 Td (International travel requires a completed International Travel Pre-Approval form \(F-221\). The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 96 Td (form must be submitted at least 14 days before the planned departure date and approved by your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 83 Td (budget holder. The form records the purpose of the trip, the estimated total cost and the cost) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 70 Td (centre to be charged. Travel booked without an approved F-221 may not be reimbursed. Urgent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 57 Td (customer site visits that cannot meet the 14-day lead time may be approved by the budget holder) Tj ET
endstream
