BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (with a written reason attached to the F-221.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 707 Td (Book flights, rail and hotels through the Travel module in Atlas, which connects to our travel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 694 Td (management company. Step-by-step instructions, including how out-of-policy bookings are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 681 Td (handled, are in the Travel Booking Guide. Bookings made outside Atlas are only reimbursed when) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 668 Td (the Atlas option was unavailable or demonstrably more expensive, and the reason must be stated) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 655 Td (on the claim.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 630 Td (4. Air travel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 608 Td (Class of travel is determined by the scheduled flight time of each individual flight, not the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 595 Td (total journey time.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 573 Td (- Flights under 8 hours: economy class.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 560 Td (- Flights of 8 hours or more: premium economy class may be booked.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 547 Td (- Flights over 10 hours: business class may be booked with prior approval from the CFO.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 534 Td (Book at least 14 days ahead where possible and choose the lowest logical fare. Seat selection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 521 Td (and one checked bag are reimbursable. Airline lounge memberships are not. Where a flight lands) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 508 Td (before 07:00 local time after an overnight journey, a day-room at the destination hotel may be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 495 Td (claimed within the hotel cap.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 470 Td (5. Rail travel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 448 Td (Standard class is the default for all rail travel. First class may be booked where the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 435 Td (scheduled journey time exceeds 4 hours, or where an advance first class ticket is cheaper than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 422 Td (the flexible standard fare. Railcards purchased for frequent business travel are reimbursable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 409 Td (where they pay for themselves within the year. Leeds to London journeys are standard class) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 396 Td (unless an advance first class fare is cheaper.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 371 Td (6. Road travel and mileage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 349 Td (Use of a private car for business travel is reimbursed per unit of distance at the rates below.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 336 Td (Commuting between home and your normal place of work is not business mileage. Mileage must be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 323 Td (recorded on a Mileage Log \(F-207\) or entered in the mileage section of the Atlas claim, showing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 310 Td (date, start point, destination, purpose and distance.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 289 Td (Country | Rate) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 277 Td (UK | 45p per mile, first 10,000 miles) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 265 Td (UK | 25p per mile, above 10,000 miles) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 253 Td (Netherlands | \2000.23 per km) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 241 Td (United States | $0.70 per mile) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 229 Td (Malaysia | RM 0.90 per km) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 207 Td (Employees who receive a car allowance or a company car under the Company Car and Car Allowance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 194 Td (Policy \(POL-FIN-015\) must follow that policy for business mileage; the rates above do not apply) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 181 Td (to them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 159 Td (Hire cars should be compact or intermediate class and booked through Atlas. Refuel before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 146 Td (returning the vehicle. Electric hire cars are preferred where charging is practical. Taxis and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 133 Td (ride-hailing services are reimbursed where no reasonable public transport option exists, when) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 120 Td (carrying heavy equipment such as Tessera demonstration kits, or when travelling after 21:00.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 95 Td (7. Accommodation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 73 Td (Hotels should be booked through Atlas at or below the nightly cap for the city. Caps are per) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 60 Td (room per night and include breakfast where offered, but exclude local tourist taxes. Where a) Tj ET
