BT /F1 10 Tf 54 203 Td (attendees. Gifts and hospitality given to or received from third parties must also be recorded) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 190 Td (where required by the Code of Conduct \(POL-CORP-001\). Spend above the client entertainment) Tj ET
