BT /F2 13 Tf 54 648 Td (11. Submitting a claim) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 626 Td (Claims are submitted in Atlas under Atlas > Expenses > New Claim. Each claim must show the cost) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 613 Td (centre, the business purpose and, for meals and entertainment, the names of the people present.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 591 Td (An itemised receipt is required for every item over \2435 \(or local equivalent\). Photographs of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 578 Td (receipts uploaded to Atlas are acceptable; keep the originals until the claim is paid. Card) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 565 Td (statements and payment-terminal slips are not a substitute for an itemised receipt.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 543 Td (Claims must be submitted within 60 days of the date the expense was incurred. Claims older than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 530 Td (60 days will be rejected unless the Group Financial Controller agrees an exception in writing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 508 Td (Reimbursement is paid through payroll. The cut-off dates for each site are published in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 495 Td (payroll calendars, and an approved claim that misses a cut-off is paid in the following pay) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 482 Td (run.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 457 Td (12. Approval thresholds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 435 Td (Each claim is routed for approval in Atlas according to its total value.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 414 Td (Claim total | Approver) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 402 Td (Up to \243750 | Line manager) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 390 Td (\243750.01 to \2433,000 | Budget holder) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 378 Td (Above \2433,000 | CFO) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 356 Td (No one may approve their own claim or a claim from someone to whom they report. Claims from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 343 Td (members of the Executive team are approved by the CFO; claims from the CFO are approved by the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 330 Td (CEO. Approvers should reject claims that lack receipts, a business purpose or attendee names) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 317 Td (rather than approving them with a comment.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 292 Td (13. Compliance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 270 Td (Finance audits a sample of claims every month. Claims that breach this policy will be returned) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 257 Td (or reduced. Deliberately false or inflated claims are treated as gross misconduct under the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 244 Td (Disciplinary and Grievance Procedure \(POL-HR-040\).) Tj ET
